
# qunibone-platform.env
# Setting to adapt generic "QUniBone" software installation
# to either "UniBone" or "QBone" hardware platform.
#
# Bound to specific hardware, not part of github repository:
# copied from this example file by qunibone-platform-env.sh when missing.
# Must default to "UniBone" config!
#
# This is the ONLY place where the target platform is defined, for the
# BeagleBone build (compile.sh) as well as for the cross compile (crossco).
# The file tree suffix _u/_q is derived from it by qunibone-platform-env.sh,
# never set here (it was QUNIBONE_PLATFORM_SUFFIX, before that PLATFORM_SUFFIX).

# Important for makefiles and scripts (was MAKE_QUNIBUS)
#QUNIBONE_PLATFORM=QBUS
#QUNIBONE_PLATFORM=UNIBUS
